{%- comment -%}
  theinmag-shop-hero
  Stage 5 /shop page hero. Editorial latest-mag feature with three
  auto-cycling states driven by shop metafields:

    countdown    - pre-release window. "MagXX drops in N days. Pre-order open."
                   Eyebrow "Coming soon", peach Pre-order stamp on the photo.
                   Headline + CTA point at the NEXT issue (current + 1).
                   Active when diff_days (release - today) > 21.
    just-dropped - release window. "MagXX is here." Eyebrow "Just dropped".
                   Points at the CURRENT issue. Active when diff_days is
                   between -21 and 21 inclusive.
    available    - "MagXX". Eyebrow "Latest issue". Points at the CURRENT
                   issue. Active when diff_days < -21.

  Metafields read:
    shop.metafields.theinmag.current_issue_number  -> e.g. "Mag09" (full string)
    shop.metafields.theinmag.next_release_date     -> date, drives state + countdown
    shop.metafields.theinmag.current_issue_print_in_stock -> not used here,
                                                            reserved for sold-out
                                                            display logic
    shop.metafields.judgeme.{all_reviews_rating,all_reviews_count} -> aggregate

  Stage 14 dependencies (flag for the new-issue release flow):
    - During the countdown window, the hero CTA links to /products/{{ next_handle }}
      (e.g. /products/mag10). That product must exist + accept pre-orders before
      pre-sale opens, or the CTA 404s.
    - next_release_date metafield must continue pointing at the upcoming release
      through the 21-day just-dropped window (do not flip to the next-next release
      immediately on release day, or just-dropped is never visible).
    - Hero photo asset: section setting hero_image wins; fallback is filename
      pattern hero-shop-{handle}.jpg in /assets/. Release flow can either upload
      the new hero photo into /assets/ matching that filename OR set the image
      picker via theme editor.

  Spec: Stage 5 build brief Part 3.1.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign current_issue = shop.metafields.theinmag.current_issue_number.value | default: 'Mag09'
  assign next_release_value = shop.metafields.theinmag.next_release_date.value

  comment
    Derive handles. current_issue is stored as the full "Mag09" string so
    the current product handle is just the lowercase. Next issue is current
    plus 1 with zero-padding so "Mag09" -> next "Mag10", "Mag10" -> "Mag11".
  endcomment
  assign current_handle = current_issue | downcase
  assign current_num_str = current_issue | remove: 'Mag'
  assign current_num = current_num_str | times: 1
  assign next_num = current_num | plus: 1
  if next_num < 10
    assign next_issue = 'Mag0' | append: next_num
    assign next_handle = 'mag0' | append: next_num
  else
    assign next_issue = 'Mag' | append: next_num
    assign next_handle = 'mag' | append: next_num
  endif

  comment
    Determine hero state from diff_days = next_release_date - today, both
    normalised to midnight so the count is an exact integer. The announcement
    bar uses the identical midnight-normalised math so the two countdowns
    always show the same number.
      diff_days > 21        -> countdown (pre-release)
      -21 to 21 inclusive   -> just-dropped (release window)
      diff_days < -21       -> available
    days_until_release is the positive countdown value (for copy).
  endcomment
  assign hero_state = 'available'
  assign days_until_release = 0
  if next_release_value != blank
    assign release_midnight = next_release_value | date: '%Y-%m-%d' | date: '%s' | times: 1
    assign now_midnight = 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%d' | date: '%s' | times: 1
    assign diff_days = release_midnight | minus: now_midnight | divided_by: 86400
    if diff_days > 21
      assign hero_state = 'countdown'
      assign days_until_release = diff_days
    elsif diff_days >= -21
      assign hero_state = 'just-dropped'
    else
      assign hero_state = 'available'
    endif
  endif

  comment
    Hero copy bound to state. In countdown state the headline + CTA target
    the NEXT issue; in just-dropped/available they target the CURRENT issue.
  endcomment
  if hero_state == 'countdown'
    assign hero_mag = next_issue
    assign hero_handle = next_handle
    assign eyebrow = 'Coming soon'
    capture headline
      echo hero_mag
      echo ' drops in '
      echo days_until_release
      if days_until_release == 1
        echo ' day'
      else
        echo ' days'
      endif
    endcapture
    assign subhead = section.settings.subhead_countdown | default: 'Pre-order open. Drops into letterboxes right across Australia, very soon.'
    assign primary_label = 'Pre-order'
    assign primary_label = primary_label | append: ' ' | append: hero_mag
  elsif hero_state == 'just-dropped'
    assign hero_mag = current_issue
    assign hero_handle = current_handle
    assign eyebrow = 'Just dropped'
    capture headline
      echo hero_mag
      echo ' is here'
    endcapture
    assign subhead = section.settings.subhead_just_dropped | default: '120+ pages of pure creativity. Made by Aussie kids, sustainably printed in Australia.'
    assign primary_label = 'Shop ' | append: hero_mag
  else
    assign hero_mag = current_issue
    assign hero_handle = current_handle
    assign eyebrow = 'Latest issue'
    assign headline = hero_mag
    assign subhead = section.settings.subhead_available | default: '120+ pages of pure creativity. Made by Aussie kids, sustainably printed in Australia.'
    assign primary_label = 'Shop ' | append: hero_mag
  endif

  assign primary_url = '/products/' | append: hero_handle
  assign secondary_label = 'See inside'
  assign secondary_url = primary_url | append: '#flick-through'

  comment
    Photo source, resolved in priority order:
      1. hero_image      - theme editor image picker (responsive srcset)
      2. hero_image_filename - manual filename of an asset in /assets/
      3. hero-shop-{handle}.jpg - filename convention fallback
    If none resolve the photo pane falls back to the cream background.
  endcomment
  assign hero_image = section.settings.hero_image
  assign hero_image_manual = section.settings.hero_image_filename | strip
  assign hero_image_alt = section.settings.hero_image_alt | default: 'theINmag latest issue cover photo.'

  assign hero_image_asset_url = ''
  if hero_image_manual != blank
    assign hero_image_asset_url = hero_image_manual | asset_url
  else
    assign convention_filename = 'hero-shop-' | append: hero_handle | append: '.jpg'
    assign hero_image_asset_url = convention_filename | asset_url
  endif

  comment
    Price line. Reads variants of the target product if it exists in this
    storefront context. Falls back to brand-standard pricing line when the
    product isn't yet created (countdown state for an unreleased mag).
  endcomment
  assign target_product = all_products[hero_handle]
  assign print_price = ''
  assign digital_price = ''
  if target_product != blank and target_product.id != blank
    for v in target_product.variants
      assign vt = v.title | downcase
      if print_price == '' and vt contains 'print'
        assign print_price = v.price | money
      elsif digital_price == '' and vt contains 'digital'
        assign digital_price = v.price | money
      endif
    endfor
  endif
  if print_price == ''
    assign print_price = '$23.95'
  endif
  if digital_price == ''
    assign digital_price = '$10.45'
  endif

  comment
    Judge.me aggregate stamp. Hidden until the shop has reviews so we
    never show "0 reviews" - empty-state honesty per Bible Part 11.
  endcomment
  assign jm = shop.metafields.judgeme
  assign jm_rating = jm.all_reviews_rating | default: 0
  assign jm_count = jm.all_reviews_count | default: 0
  assign show_rating = false
  if jm_count != 0 and jm_count != blank
    assign show_rating = true
  endif

  assign section_style = '--tsh-pt: ' | append: section.settings.padding_top | append: 'px; --tsh-pb: ' | append: section.settings.padding_bottom | append: 'px;'
-%}

<section
  class="theinmag-shop-hero"
  data-theinmag-shop-hero
  data-hero-state="{{ hero_state }}"
  aria-labelledby="theinmag-shop-hero-heading"
  style="{{ section_style }}"
>
  <div class="theinmag-shop-hero__inner">

    {%- comment -%} LEFT pane (desktop) / TOP (mobile): hero photo {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="theinmag-shop-hero__photo">
      {%- if hero_image != blank -%}
        <img
          class="theinmag-shop-hero__image"
          src="{{ hero_image | image_url: width: 1400 }}"
          srcset="{{ hero_image | image_url: width: 720 }} 720w, {{ hero_image | image_url: width: 1080 }} 1080w, {{ hero_image | image_url: width: 1400 }} 1400w, {{ hero_image | image_url: width: 1800 }} 1800w"
          sizes="(min-width: 990px) 50vw, 100vw"
          alt="{{ hero_image_alt | escape }}"
          width="1400"
          height="1400"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        >
      {%- else -%}
        <img
          class="theinmag-shop-hero__image"
          src="{{ hero_image_asset_url }}"
          alt="{{ hero_image_alt | escape }}"
          width="1400"
          height="1400"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          onerror="this.style.display='none'"
        >
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if hero_state == 'countdown' -%}
        <span class="theinmag-shop-hero__preorder-stamp" aria-label="Pre-order open">Pre-order</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} RIGHT pane (desktop) / BOTTOM (mobile): copy {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="theinmag-shop-hero__copy">
      <p class="theinmag-shop-hero__eyebrow">{{ eyebrow }}</p>
      <h1 id="theinmag-shop-hero-heading" class="theinmag-shop-hero__headline">{{ headline }}</h1>
      <p class="theinmag-shop-hero__subhead">{{ subhead }}</p>

      {%- if show_rating -%}
        <a href="#theinmag-reviews-heading" class="theinmag-shop-hero__rating" data-rating-jump aria-label="Read {{ jm_count }} customer reviews across our printed mags">
          <span data-score="{{ jm_rating }}" class="jdgm-all-reviews-rating" aria-label="{{ jm_rating | round: 1 }} stars" role="img"></span>
          <span class="theinmag-shop-hero__rating-meta">{{ jm_rating | round: 1 }} - {{ jm_count }} reviews across our printed mags</span>
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}

      <p class="theinmag-shop-hero__price">{{ print_price }} print - {{ digital_price }} digital</p>

      <div class="theinmag-shop-hero__ctas">
        <a class="theinmag-shop-hero__cta theinmag-shop-hero__cta--primary" href="{{ primary_url }}">{{ primary_label }}</a>
        <a class="theinmag-shop-hero__cta theinmag-shop-hero__cta--secondary" href="{{ secondary_url }}">{{ secondary_label }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%}
  Page-level JSON-LD for /shop. Three nodes:
    BreadcrumbList - Home -> Shop
    CollectionPage - the /shop page itself
    ItemList       - the latest mag featured here (full grid ItemList is the
                     shop-grid section's responsibility once that ships).
{%- endcomment -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": {{ shop.url | json }}},
      {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Shop", "item": {{ shop.url | append: '/pages/shop' | json }}}
    ]
  }
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "CollectionPage",
    "name": "Shop",
    "description": "Shop the latest theINmag - kid-created, ad-free, sustainably printed in Australia.",
    "url": {{ shop.url | append: '/pages/shop' | json }}
  }
</script>

{%- comment -%}
  ItemList JSON-LD is emitted by theinmag-shop-grid below this section
  with the full product list. Don't duplicate it here.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- stylesheet -%}
  .theinmag-shop-hero {
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    padding: var(--tsh-pt, 0) 0 var(--tsh-pb, 0);
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    /* Mobile: photo on top, copy beneath. Total section height grows
       organically from content. */
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .theinmag-shop-hero__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      min-height: clamp(560px, 75vh, 800px);
    }
  }

  /* ---------- Photo pane ---------- */

  .theinmag-shop-hero__photo {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
  }

  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .theinmag-shop-hero__photo {
      aspect-ratio: auto;
      height: 100%;
      min-height: clamp(560px, 75vh, 800px);
    }
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  /* Pre-order stamp - peach pill, top-right corner of photo. Soft shadow
     so it lifts off the photo without competing. Only visible in countdown
     state via the data-hero-state CSS hook on the section root. */
  .theinmag-shop-hero__preorder-stamp {
    position: absolute;
    top: var(--space-md);
    right: var(--space-md);
    background-color: var(--color-peach, #FCDDB8);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.15);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  /* ---------- Copy pane ---------- */

  .theinmag-shop-hero__copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 64px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px);
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-coral-dark, #C9543E);
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__headline {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5.5vw, 64px);
    line-height: 1.02;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__subhead {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    opacity: 0.85;
    /* Wide enough to keep the countdown subhead on one line on desktop;
       still wraps on narrow viewports as the font + column scale down. */
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  /* Aggregate rating - sits just under the subhead, links to #reviews. */
  .theinmag-shop-hero__rating {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .theinmag-shop-hero__rating .jdgm-all-reviews-rating {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .theinmag-shop-hero__rating-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    opacity: 0.82;
  }

  /* Price line - subdued, between rating and CTAs. */
  .theinmag-shop-hero__price {
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(15px, 1.7vw, 17px);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
  }

  /* CTAs - primary yellow sticker (locked convention) + outlined secondary. */
  .theinmag-shop-hero__ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.8vw, 20px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-button);
    transition: background var(--transition-standard), color var(--transition-standard), translate var(--transition-standard), box-shadow var(--transition-standard);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__cta--primary {
    background: var(--color-yellow);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    border: 0;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-button-yellow);
  }
  .theinmag-shop-hero__cta--primary:hover,
  .theinmag-shop-hero__cta--primary:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-purple-dark);
    color: #ffffff;
    translate: 0 2px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-button-pressed);
    outline: none;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-hero__cta--secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
  }
  .theinmag-shop-hero__cta--secondary:hover,
  .theinmag-shop-hero__cta--secondary:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    color: var(--color-cream);
    outline: none;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .theinmag-shop-hero__cta--primary:hover {
      translate: 0 0;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-button-yellow);
    }
  }
{%- endstylesheet -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Shop hero",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "shopify-section theinmag-shop-hero-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Editorial latest-mag feature. Auto-cycles three states (countdown / just-dropped / available) from shop metafields theinmag.current_issue_number + theinmag.next_release_date. Photo source: section setting wins; fallback is filename pattern hero-shop-{handle}.jpg in /assets/."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Hero photo"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "hero_image",
      "label": "Hero photo"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "hero_image_filename",
      "label": "Hero photo filename (fallback)",
      "info": "Filename of an image in /assets/ - used when the picker above is empty. Falls back to hero-shop-{handle}.jpg if both are empty.",
      "default": "mag08-01-cover-MOCKUP.jpg"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "hero_image_alt",
      "label": "Hero photo alt text",
      "default": "theINmag latest issue cover photo."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Subhead copy (per state)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The eyebrow + headline auto-generate from the issue metafields. These three subheads are editable - the hero shows whichever one matches the current state."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subhead_countdown",
      "label": "Subhead - countdown state",
      "info": "Shown when the next issue is more than 21 days from release.",
      "default": "Pre-order open. Drops into letterboxes right across Australia, very soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subhead_just_dropped",
      "label": "Subhead - just dropped state",
      "info": "Shown for the first 21 days after a release.",
      "default": "120+ pages of pure creativity. Made by Aussie kids, sustainably printed in Australia."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subhead_available",
      "label": "Subhead - available state",
      "info": "Shown once an issue is more than 21 days past release.",
      "default": "120+ pages of pure creativity. Made by Aussie kids, sustainably printed in Australia."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Spacing"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "label": "Padding top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 128,
      "step": 4,
      "default": 0,
      "unit": "px"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "label": "Padding bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 128,
      "step": 4,
      "default": 0,
      "unit": "px"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Shop hero" }
  ],
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["page"]
  }
}
{% endschema %}
